<title>USA: Cenfed Financial Corp Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Cenfed Financial Corp Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								 March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net interest income			   $13,257	$12,137</p>
<p> Provisions for loan losses		  (2,500)	(2,800)</p>
<p> Non-interest income			     2,744	  6,930</p>
<p> Extraordinary item				    -	  (364)</p>
<p> Net earnings					3,536	  4,286</p>
<p> Shr						    0.60	   0.75</p>
<p>Notes: (1) Stockholders' equity at March 31, 1997 and Dec. 31, 1996 included unrealized losses of $2.5 million and $237,000, respectively, to record investment and mortgage-backed securities available for sale at fair value.</p>
<p>(2) Shares outstanding have not been adjusted to reflect a 10 percent stock dividend declared in April 1997.</p>
<p>(3) Core shr is $0.49 vs $0.30. &quot;Core earnings&quot; exclude gains/losses on sales of investments and mortgage-backed securities, results of real estate opers and nonrecurring adjustments.</p>
</text>
